    799  f0da							; --- Cave TIA restores inside the VBL window (moved 2026-10-06) ---
    800  f0da							; Was inline between VBL-tail and .Row: making it a jsr'd KernelInit
    801  f0da							; added ~19c + an entry WSYNC to the cycle-precise VBL-tail→.Row span
    802  f0da							; → wall 263→264 every frame. Inits live HERE (window headroom
    803  f0da							; 1472-1076 ≈ 396c, cost ~25c) so the entry span SHRINKS vs inline.
    804  f0da							; HUD cannot clobber these: HUD runs AFTER the kernel each frame.
