   1357  f25a							; --- Physics: vy += GRAVITY (gravity), vy -= JetPower (jet thrust). ---
   1358  f25a							;     JetPower b7 = float flag (bugs #31): float frames add gravity
   1359  f25a							;     only — subtracting $80+ would blast the player upward.
   1360  f25a				   .Gravity
