   1651  f3c9							; Snake patrol: bounds are SYMMETRIC about the ROM spawn X (± SNAKE_PATROL =
   1652  f3c9							; one tile, user 2026-10-19 — see the constant): retreat a tile behind the
   1653  f3c9							; placement, come out a tile, repeat. The ROM dir names the side it comes OUT
   1654  f3c9							; on: the loader inverts a snake's live dir at room load (bank2 EnterRoomB2),
   1655  f3c9							; so the first move is the retreat into its wall. Ignores editor range_* per
   1656  f3c9							; user 2026-09-23. No wall collision.
