   2676  f802							; SOSkipTail — the rotation slot picked a DEAD enemy (or a taken key). It used
   2677  f802							; to draw nothing, so the survivor showed only every 2nd frame: kill the enemy
   2678  f802							; next to the miner and the MINER started flickering (user 2026-10-25), and a
   2679  f802							; two-enemy room flickered its survivor. Hand the slot on instead:
   2680  f802							;   1. the miner is here -> draw the miner (every frame once the enemy is gone);
   2681  f802							;   2. else the room's other enemy (index ^ 1) if it exists and is alive;
   2682  f802							;   3. else nothing.
   2683  f802							; Terminates: step 2 jumps into the live path only for a LIVE partner, and a
   2684  f802							; taken key can re-enter here only once per frame (its partner is then dead).
