   3099  f9c1							; VBL block, so the ball block became this jsr and the body sits in the
   3100  f9c1							; $F9C4..$FBF7 fill (ReturnPad pin at $FBF8 unaffected; F6-safe:
   3101  f9c1							; $F9C4 & $1FFF = $19C4 ∉ $1FF4-$1FF7; bank0-only, not a fold twin).
   3102  f9c1							;   Temp	   = staged BallX (bank2 StageBandTab): 0 = symmetric → skip.
