   3526  fba4							; CEH_KeyDisp / power cell (record type 14 = KEY|8, user request 2026-10-26):
   3527  fba4							; every `and #7` in the type consumers folds 14 to 6, so CheckEnemyHit lands on
   3528  fba4							; the key arm; this entry re-reads the record (FetchPtr is still staged) and
   3529  fba4							; sends a type-14 record to the cell: the slot vanishes (no life, no score), the
   3530  fba4							; timer bar is refilled to BAR_MAX, and bit (RoomNo & 3) of LevelStartRoom b3-0
   3531  fba4							; latches so bank2's room load keeps it dead on re-entry (one refill per cell
   3532  fba4							; per level: leaving and coming back is not an infinite recharge). TickCounter is
   3533  fba4							; left alone on purpose - the 60-frame clock also paces PickPlayerFrame, and a
   3534  fba4							; partial second on top of a full bar is harmless. The generator keeps cell
   3535  fba4							; rooms distinct mod 4. Guard: tools/test_power_cell.py.
   3536  fba4							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
