   3611  fbe8							; 2026-10-28 (flicker): extra passes are GOVERNED by the overscan timer. A pass starts
   3612  fbe8							; only while INTIM >= UE_MIN_INTIM (pass ~250c + the tail work after UpdateEnemies);
   3613  fbe8							; otherwise it is dropped, so a frame that already spent its time on 3 PlayerHitsMap
   3614  fbe8							; calls does not overrun into 273+ lines. The first pass always runs. EnemySpd is
   3615  fbe8							; never 0 here (LoadLevel sets it; sim_frame_budget asserts it), so the old `bmi`
   3616  fbe8							; guard went to make room. An expired timer reads as a wrapped INTIM (>= $80 for
