   3817  fc80							; hot rock, band). Returns C=1: lives exhausted, ReloadLevel already done
   3818  fc80							; (LoadLevel re-places the player — callers skip their stay action).
   3819  fc80							; C=0: still alive — physics zeroed here; caller does its per-site stay
   3820  fc80							; action (bar reload, RoomY shift). Tail-callable (`jmp LoseLife`).
