   4029  fd29							; --- SELECT/UP/DOWN edge + RESET/FIRE edge (TitleSelect, bank1) ---
   4030  fd29							;     It samples console + joystick, stores the sample in StepsLeft for
   4031  fd29							;     next frame's edges, and returns A != 0 for a RESET/FIRE start edge,
   4032  fd29							;     else A = 0 with C = level changed (Z/C survive the pad).
   4033  fd29		       20 4f fc 	      jsr	CallPad_TitleSelect
