   4085  fd64							; (decrements 60->1, reloads) — gates derived
   4086  fd64							; from it wrapped every second (spider
   4087  fd64							; "teleported": (TC>>3)&63 only ever saw
   4088  fd64							; 0..7 and counted DOWN 0->7 = jump).
