   4134  fd9d							; BuildColupF — 12-byte final COLUPF image at ColupfBuf ($E7-$F2).
   4135  fd9d							;   Stripe: rows 0,2 = LevelWallColor; row 1 = LevelWallColor2.
   4136  fd9d							;   Hot rows overwrite with the TickCounter-bit5 pulse (amber/red).
   4137  fd9d							;   $F0-$F2 (bombs) NO LONGER overlap-saved: body writes rows 0-2 only,
   4138  fd9d							;   save/restore round trip deleted (S3.0b — window audit: zero writers).
   4139  fd9d							;   Bank1 clobbers $E0-$EF during HUD; VBLANK rebuilds every frame.
   4140  fd9d							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   4141  fd9d							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   4142  fd9d							; BuildColupF — MOVED to bank2 (S5.1) — CallPad_BuildColupF.
   4143  fd9d							;   Hot-rect data (RoomRects) lives in bank2, so the body reads it with
   4144  fd9d							;   direct (FetchPtr),Y — the shared $FEF6 fold block's sta $1FF4 always
   4145  fd9d							;   returns to bank0, so a fold inside a bank1 body could not work.
   4146  fd9d							;   The dark check is inlined there too: CallPad_IsRoomDark cannot nest
   4147  fd9d							;   from a pad body (ReturnPad switches to bank0 mid-call).
   4148  fd9d							;   Body: bank2.asm, pinned at $FC4F. Entry save block ($F0-$F2 → collision
   4149  fd9d							;   temps) was dead (rows 0-2 only) — deleted with the .AfterRows restore
   4150  fd9d							;   in S3.0b.
   4151  fd9d							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
