   4174  fdc5							; BombEnemyBlast — bank2 entry tramp ($FDD8, lamp-safe S9 2026-10-07): the
   4175  fdc5							; BombTick `jsr` lands here (bank0), `sta $1FF6` switches to bank2, the `jmp`
   4176  fdc5							; is fetched from bank2's byte-identical mirror at this same address and
   4177  fdc5							; lands on the body at $FD87 (the lamp type-check reads enemy records that
   4178  fdc5							; live in bank2). Body tail-jmps ReturnPad ($FBF8); A = 1 kill (BombTick
   4179  fdc5							; awards +50 — pads cannot nest), 0 none. Old inline body ($F87F, 66B)
   4180  fdc5							; deleted: the region re-packs into the gap before the $FBD6 fold pin
   4181  fdc5							; (pre-pad headroom stays 1B — pins absorb upstream shrink, not the org).
