   4689  ff4f							; old S3 sweep extent (SweepOff max 16: right tip <= RoomX+20, left
   4690  ff4f							; floor max(RoomX-20,0)) — past the cap restarts at the eye, the
   4691  ff4f							; triangle-loop feel of the sweep (user: beam "moved way beyond the
